<title>USA: Elbit Medical Q1 shr $0.01, with charge.</title>
<headline>Elbit Medical Q1 shr $0.01, with charge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>(U.S.$ in millions, except per share information)</p>
<p>					   Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						  March 31,</p>
<p>					   1997	     1996</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>  Elscint			$     70.4	$    71.4</p>
