<p> of shares Outstanding	   21,386	   21,386</p>
<p>Note: Elbit Medical Imaging Ltd is based in Haifa, Israel. First quarter 1997 net income includes a one-time charge of $900,000 primarily due to the reorganization and consolidation of operations at Elbit Ultrasound subsidiary that was completed in the quarter. Net income for the same period last year included a one-time $2.0 million gain, resulting from reducing the company's holdings in the Hungarian company OMKER. --((New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
